[2.3800000000000017, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.88, "o", "0.990\tCancel my subscription immediately and refund the last charge. Worst support ever.\r\n"]
[3.88, "o", "0.978\tWHY does it log me out every five minutes?? Absolutely unacceptable.\r\n"]
[3.88, "o", "0.900\tThis is the third time checkout has failed this week. I am done with this app.\r\n"]
[3.88, "o", "0.855\tYour sales rep promised a feature that does not exist. I feel lied to.\r\n"]
[3.88, "o", "0.085\tThe mobile app is a bit slow on older phones but works fine.\r\n"]
[3.88, "o", "0.007\tWould be great to have a dark mode.\r\n"]
[3.88, "o", "0.000\tLove the new dashboard, thanks team!\r\n"]
[3.88, "o", "0.000\tHow do I export my data to CSV?\r\n"]
[3.88, "o", "0.000\tPricing question: do you offer enterprise seats?\r\n"]
[3.88, "o", "0.000\tEverything works as expected, no complaints.\r\n"]
